msgid "Allow AI bot crawling"
msgstr "Crawling durch KI-Bots erlauben"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:278
msgid ""
"If off, robots.txt asks AI crawlers (GPTBot, ChatGPT-User, Google-Extended, "
"CCBot, Anthropic, Meta, Bytespider, PerplexityBot) to stay away."
msgstr ""
"Wenn deaktiviert, bittet robots.txt KI-Crawler (GPTBot, ChatGPT-User, Google-"
"Extended, CCBot, Anthropic, Meta, Bytespider, PerplexityBot), fernzubleiben."

