msgstr "PayPal-Client-ID (Test)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:689
msgid ""
"In the PayPal Developer dashboard open Apps & Credentials, choose Sandbox and"
" copy the Client ID of your app."
msgstr ""
"Öffnen Sie im PayPal Developer Dashboard Apps & Credentials, wählen Sie "
"Sandbox und kopieren Sie die Client ID Ihrer App."

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:694
msgid "PayPal secret (test)"
msgstr "PayPal-Geheimnis (Test)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:696
msgid ""
"Shown next to the Client ID of the same Sandbox app in PayPal Developer > "
"Apps & Credentials. Never share it."
msgstr ""
"Steht neben der Client ID derselben Sandbox-App unter PayPal Developer > Apps"
" & Credentials. Geben Sie diesen Wert nie weiter."

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:703
msgid "Stripe enabled (live)"
msgstr "Stripe aktiviert (Live)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:707
msgid "Stripe public key (live)"
msgstr "Öffentlicher Stripe-Schlüssel (Live)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:709
msgid ""
"In the Stripe Dashboard, turn off test mode and open Developers > API keys. "
"Copy the publishable key (pk_live_...)."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivieren Sie im Stripe Dashboard den Testmodus und öffnen Sie Developers "
"> API keys. Kopieren Sie den Publishable Key (pk_live_...)."

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:714
msgid "Stripe secret key (live)"
msgstr "Geheimer Stripe-Schlüssel (Live)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:716
msgid ""
"In the Stripe Dashboard, turn off test mode and open Developers > API keys. "
"Copy the secret key (sk_live_...) and never share it."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivieren Sie im Stripe Dashboard den Testmodus und öffnen Sie Developers "
"> API keys. Kopieren Sie den Secret Key (sk_live_...) und geben Sie ihn nie "
"weiter."

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:721
msgid "Stripe webhook secret (live)"
msgstr "Stripe-Webhook-Geheimnis (Live)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:723
msgid ""
"With test mode off, open Developers > Webhooks and add the endpoint "
"https://your-domain/en/events/payment/webhook/stripe/ with the event "
"checkout.session.completed, then copy its signing secret (whsec_...). It "
"confirms payments even when the member does not come back to the site after "
"paying."
msgstr ""
"Öffnen Sie bei deaktiviertem Testmodus Developers > Webhooks und fügen Sie "
"den Endpunkt https://your-domain/en/events/payment/webhook/stripe/ mit dem "
"Ereignis checkout.session.completed hinzu. Kopieren Sie dann sein Signing "
"Secret (whsec_...). Es bestätigt Zahlungen auch dann, wenn das Mitglied nach "
"dem Bezahlen nicht auf die Website zurückkehrt."

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:733
msgid "PayPal enabled (live)"
msgstr "PayPal aktiviert (Live)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:737
msgid "PayPal client ID (live)"
msgstr "PayPal-Client-ID (Live)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:739
msgid ""
"In the PayPal Developer dashboard open Apps & Credentials, choose Live and "
"copy the Client ID of your app."
msgstr ""
"Öffnen Sie im PayPal Developer Dashboard Apps & Credentials, wählen Sie Live "
"und kopieren Sie die Client ID Ihrer App."

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:744
msgid "PayPal secret (live)"
msgstr "PayPal-Geheimnis (Live)"

#: apps/website/models/settings.py:746
msgid ""
"Shown next to the Client ID of the same Live app in PayPal Developer > Apps &"
" Credentials. Never share it."
msgstr ""
"Steht neben der Client ID derselben Live-App unter PayPal Developer > Apps & "
"Credentials. Geben Sie diesen Wert nie weiter."

